{"id":"173e95f9b43447c0","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition.md","title":"Definition — 局部连通的切片 Frobenius 条件","display":"Definition — 局部连通的切片 Frobenius 条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition","aliases":["14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition"],"display":"Definition — 局部连通的切片 Frobenius 条件","depends_on":["[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 局部连通的切片 Frobenius 条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(L:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为候选函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>，拉回谓词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a>；同构谓词的环境下标采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a>。</p>\n<p>以下比较箭头定义部分取满足该伴随数据谓词的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,\\varepsilon\">\\(\\eta,\\varepsilon\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:A\\to f^*B\">\\(a:A\\to f^*B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:B&#39;\\to B\">\\(b:B&#39;\\to B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,p_1,p_2)\">\\((P,p_1,p_2)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,f^*(b)\">\\(a,f^*(b)\\)</span> 的拉回；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,q_1,q_2)\">\\((Q,q_1,q_2)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),b\">\\(\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),b\\)</span> 的拉回。定义谓词时对这些伴随数据与拉回数据显式量化，不预先固定未列入参数的伴随选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline a^{\\varepsilon}:=\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),\\qquad\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}:=\\varepsilon_{B&#39;}\\circ L(p_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline a^{\\varepsilon}:=\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),\\qquad\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}:=\\varepsilon_{B&#39;}\\circ L(p_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline a^{\\varepsilon}\\circ L(p_1)=b\\circ\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline a^{\\varepsilon}\\circ L(p_1)=b\\circ\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\quad(q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\quad(q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{a,b}^{\\varepsilon}:=\\iota w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\ (q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_{a,b}^{\\varepsilon}:=\\iota w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\ (q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsIndexedFrobenius}(L,f^*)\\iff{}&amp;\\exists\\eta,\\varepsilon\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal F)\\ \\forall B,B&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal F}(A,f^*B)\\ \\forall b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B&#39;,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\forall P,p_1,p_2,Q,q_1,q_2\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal F}(P,p_1,p_2,a,f^*(b))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,q_1,q_2,\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),b)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Rightarrow\\exists w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\ (q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\varepsilon_{B&#39;}\\circ L(p_2)\\land\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(w))\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsIndexedFrobenius}(L,f^*)\\iff{}&amp;\\exists\\eta,\\varepsilon\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal F)\\ \\forall B,B&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal F}(A,f^*B)\\ \\forall b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B&#39;,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\forall P,p_1,p_2,Q,q_1,q_2\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal F}(P,p_1,p_2,a,f^*(b))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,q_1,q_2,\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),b)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Rightarrow\\exists w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\ (q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\varepsilon_{B&#39;}\\circ L(p_2)\\land\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(w))\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>比较箭头由两个拉回投影方程唯一决定。伴随的自然性使这两个分量满足拉回相容方程，因此唯一描述有定义。索引 Frobenius 谓词要求所有切片基变换上的该比较均可逆；伴随结构存在性与比较条件都位于正式定义内。</p>\n<p>改变拉回选择只将比较箭头在两侧复合同构；改变同一伴随的单位/余单位选择也由规范伴随同构运输。因此谓词不依赖未记录的选择，且可直接供 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"afcd93ebfca63623\" href=\"?note=afcd93ebfca63623\" title=\"14-df-locally-connected-geometric-morphism\">14-df-locally-connected-geometric-morphism</a> 的局部连通性定义使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射，$L:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为候选函子。$\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)$ 采用 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]]，拉回谓词采用 [[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]；同构谓词的环境下标采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射，$L:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为候选函子。$\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)$ 采用 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]]，拉回谓词采用 [[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]；同构谓词的环境下标采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射，$L:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为候选函子。$\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)$ 采用 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]]，拉回谓词采用 [[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]；同构谓词的环境下标采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射，$L:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为候选函子。$\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)$ 采用 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]]，拉回谓词采用 [[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]；同构谓词的环境下标采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locally-connected-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"afcd93ebfca63623","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"改变拉回选择只将比较箭头在两侧复合同构；改变同一伴随的单位/余单位选择也由规范伴随同构运输。因此谓词不依赖未记录的选择，且可直接供 [[14-df-locally-connected-geometric-morphism]] 的局部连通性定义使用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"L:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta,\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"a:A\\to f^*B","display":false},{"tex":"b:B'\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"(P,p_1,p_2)","display":false},{"tex":"a,f^*(b)","display":false},{"tex":"(Q,q_1,q_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),b","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline a^{\\varepsilon}:=\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),\\qquad\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}:=\\varepsilon_{B'}\\circ L(p_2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\overline a^{\\varepsilon}\\circ L(p_1)=b\\circ\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists!w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\quad(q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta_{a,b}^{\\varepsilon}:=\\iota w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\ (q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\overline{p_2}^{\\varepsilon}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsIndexedFrobenius}(L,f^*)\\iff{}&\\exists\\eta,\\varepsilon\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal F)\\ \\forall B,B'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal F}(A,f^*B)\\ \\forall b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B',B)\\\\\n&\\forall P,p_1,p_2,Q,q_1,q_2\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal F}(P,p_1,p_2,a,f^*(b))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,q_1,q_2,\\varepsilon_B\\circ L(a),b)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\Rightarrow\\exists w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(L(P),Q)\\ (q_1\\circ w=L(p_1)\\land q_2\\circ w=\\varepsilon_{B'}\\circ L(p_2)\\land\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(w))\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2977,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition|Definition — 局部连通的切片 Frobenius 条件]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition]]"},{"id":"afcd93ebfca63623","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本质条件见 [[14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms]]，切片 Frobenius 比较见 [[14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition]]。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition|Definition — 局部连通的切片 Frobenius 条件]]"}],"outgoing":["199dc3cf97e92fa1","9752b779c5f463f9","d2b4e5cf16585f95","55bd5d1a324171ab","d5f547b903550705","afcd93ebfca63623"]}